WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:19.754
felt embarrassed about how she'd acted on the tennis court in the game with Anna and Risa.

2
00:00:20.715 --> 00:00:24.778
But she was still mad at Javier for correcting her in front of everyone.

3
00:00:25.438 --> 00:00:26.459
He was her twin.

4
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.161
He was supposed to be on her side.

5
00:00:30.282 --> 00:00:34.114
She avoided him for the rest of the day and again the next morning.

6
00:00:34.854 --> 00:00:40.139
He seemed to have the same idea, planting himself in front of the computer after breakfast.

7
00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:45.023
Iris thought.

8
00:00:45.764 --> 00:00:51.429
Unlike Javier, Iris wanted to spend all her free time outside with her friends.

9
00:00:51.449 --> 00:00:53.611
"Mama, see you later!"

10
00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:54.652
she called.

11
00:00:55.332 --> 00:00:59.016
Mama was swinging her hips and singing a salsa tune in the kitchen.

12
00:01:02.884 --> 00:01:06.645
Iris couldn't remember the last time she'd seen her mother so happy.

13
00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:10.747
The new job had definitely improved her spirits.

14
00:01:12.047 --> 00:01:14.928
Mama turned around to blow Iris a kiss.

15
00:01:14.948 --> 00:01:18.169
"Come back in time for lunch."

16
00:01:18.989 --> 00:01:19.370
"I will."

17
00:01:22.031 --> 00:01:26.112
Iris pulled the door shut on her way out and sped for the park.

18
00:01:29.632 --> 00:01:33.395
Jake and Sophia rushed toward her as soon as she reached the field.

19
00:01:33.415 --> 00:01:41.082
"Iris!" After a group hug, Iris grinned.

20
00:01:41.102 --> 00:01:43.444
"I missed you guys this week."

21
00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.507
"We missed you too," Jake said.

22
00:01:46.527 --> 00:01:48.468
"No kidding."

23
00:01:49.269 --> 00:01:50.550
Sophia shook her head.

24
00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:54.173
"No one can dribble a soccer ball like you.

25
00:01:55.054 --> 00:01:57.136
So what's tennis camp like?"

26
00:01:58.336 --> 00:01:59.736
"It's pretty awful."

27
00:02:00.677 --> 00:02:03.257
Iris glanced wistfully at the soccer field.

28
00:02:03.277 --> 00:02:09.099
"I'm terrible at tennis, and Javier and I had a pretty big argument."

29
00:02:09.119 --> 00:02:12.220
"That stinks," Jake said.

30
00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.061
"When is camp over?"

31
00:02:14.841 --> 00:02:15.821
Iris groaned.

32
00:02:15.841 --> 00:02:18.082
"In two more weeks.

33
00:02:18.842 --> 00:02:20.842
Also known as forever."

34
00:02:20.862 --> 00:02:24.683
"It's not that long," Sophia said.

35
00:02:25.364 --> 00:02:26.204
"You can do it."

36
00:02:27.532 --> 00:02:30.173
"You're a great athlete," Jake added.

37
00:02:30.193 --> 00:02:33.234
"There's no way you're terrible at tennis."

38
00:02:33.254 --> 00:02:37.976
"Thanks, but I'm definitely terrible," Iris said.

39
00:02:38.656 --> 00:02:42.178
She told her friends a few stories about her mistakes at camp.

40
00:02:43.298 --> 00:02:44.939
Soon they were all laughing.

41
00:02:44.959 --> 00:02:47.200
"That does sound grim!"

42
00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:48.580
Sophia said.

43
00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:52.462
A few minutes later they were out on the soccer field.

44
00:02:53.202 --> 00:02:59.449
Iris sprinted down the field, breathing in the fresh grass scent and watching Sophia for a pass.

45
00:03:02.451 --> 00:03:07.353
When it came, Iris skillfully trapped the ball and dribbled toward the goal.

46
00:03:10.275 --> 00:03:16.638
Suddenly she could hear Papa's voice coaching her again: "Look for the right angle of attack, Iris."

47
00:03:17.679 --> 00:03:22.141
Iris slowed the ball, aimed her body, and kicked hard.

48
00:03:25.003 --> 00:03:26.724
The ball sailed into the net.

49
00:03:27.356 --> 00:03:30.297
Goal! "Yeah, Iris!"

50
00:03:31.058 --> 00:03:32.018
Sophia cheered.

51
00:03:32.698 --> 00:03:36.540
Iris grinned, happier than she'd been all week.

52
00:03:38.221 --> 00:03:45.224
The first thing Iris saw on Monday morning at the tennis courts was Jae—with Zoe's arm around his

53
00:03:45.304 --> 00:03:47.665
back as she corrected his serving position.

54
00:03:48.585 --> 00:03:49.906
Iris clenched her jaw.

55
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:51.947
She would show Jae.

56
00:03:52.727 --> 00:03:54.028
She would show Javier.

57
00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:58.141
She would show everyone that she was a good athlete.

58
00:03:59.022 --> 00:04:05.184
While the other kids chatted about their weekends, Iris picked up a racket and practiced her swing.

59
00:04:09.086 --> 00:04:10.586
Jake and Sophia were right.

60
00:04:11.187 --> 00:04:12.627
She was great at soccer.

61
00:04:13.327 --> 00:04:15.748
She should be at least okay at tennis.

62
00:04:17.029 --> 00:04:18.590
Grace jogged over to her.

63
00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:24.592
"Iris! You already look so much better than last week."

64
00:04:25.612 --> 00:04:27.733
"Thanks." Iris smiled.

65
00:04:27.753 --> 00:04:31.854
"Hey, would you mind practicing with me today?

66
00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:35.175
I'm ready to do whatever it takes to improve."

67
00:04:37.135 --> 00:04:39.136
"Sure." Grace smiled.

68
00:04:39.156 --> 00:04:44.117
"I love playing tennis now, but I remember what it was like when I started.

69
00:04:44.857 --> 00:04:46.938
I found it very hard at first."

70
00:04:48.258 --> 00:04:51.199
"Really?" Iris was surprised to hear this.

71
00:04:51.939 --> 00:04:54.680
Grace had so much natural ability at tennis.

72
00:04:56.052 --> 00:05:01.397
"Yeah, I really struggled with practicing my swing and hitting balls against the wall."

73
00:05:02.157 --> 00:05:03.419
Grace rolled her eyes.

74
00:05:03.439 --> 00:05:11.746
"Boring! But once Ben and I started playing together, we both realized how much fun tennis is."

75
00:05:12.947 --> 00:05:14.628
Iris sighed and shook her head.

76
00:05:14.648 --> 00:05:20.393
"I'm not sure I'll ever find tennis fun, but I'll keep practicing.

77
00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:23.336
I really want to play well in the final match."

78
00:05:24.432 --> 00:05:30.037
She stole a glance at Javier, who stood joking with Ben across the court.

79
00:05:30.698 --> 00:05:33.981
Her brother looked like he was actually enjoying camp.

80
00:05:35.042 --> 00:05:37.084
Grace followed Iris' gaze.

81
00:05:37.104 --> 00:05:42.389
"You know, sometimes a little friendly competition can make the game more fun.

82
00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.133
Actually, that gives me a great idea.

83
00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:49.536
Ally?" Grace flagged Ally down.

84
00:05:50.284 --> 00:05:54.385
"You know how we always play final matches with partners at a similar level?"

85
00:05:54.405 --> 00:05:57.346
"Yes?" Ally frowned.

86
00:05:58.146 --> 00:05:59.006
So did Iris.

87
00:05:59.707 --> 00:06:01.307
Where was Grace going with this?

88
00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:08.749
"What if we put new players with more advanced partners, and then pitted each team against a similar

89
00:06:08.809 --> 00:06:10.750
team?" "Hmm."

90
00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.070
Ally pressed her lips together.

91
00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:15.591
"It's an interesting idea, Grace.

92
00:06:16.251 --> 00:06:21.528
I'll have to run it by Julie first, but no matter what, I like how you girls think.

93
00:06:22.309 --> 00:06:24.609
We've got to keep things interesting around here.

94
00:06:25.229 --> 00:06:26.470
For everyone."

95
00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.531
Ally turned to face the rest of the group.

96
00:06:32.011 --> 00:06:33.272
"Good morning, campers!

97
00:06:34.092 --> 00:06:39.853
Choose a partner to practice with this morning, and we'll divide you into new doubles teams this afternoon.

98
00:06:40.934 --> 00:06:45.055
These doubles teams will be for your final matches at the end of next week."

99
00:06:45.695 --> 00:06:46.315
She paused.

100
00:06:46.335 --> 00:06:48.976
"You guys can go ahead and get started.

101
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.761
I need to go speak with Julie about something."

102
00:06:52.761 --> 00:06:54.621
Iris and Grace shared a grin.

103
00:06:55.342 --> 00:06:56.222
"Ready, partner?"

104
00:06:56.822 --> 00:06:57.422
Grace said.

105
00:06:58.783 --> 00:06:59.583
Iris nodded.

106
00:07:00.283 --> 00:07:02.263
She most definitely was.

107
00:07:03.984 --> 00:07:11.006
After watching Jae eat lunch with Zoe again, Iris decided to put him completely out of her mind.

108
00:07:12.226 --> 00:07:17.708
It was obvious Jae and Zoe liked each other, and Iris barely knew him anyway.

109
00:07:18.528 --> 00:07:23.251
Besides, Grace wasn't as babyish as Iris had originally thought.

110
00:07:24.312 --> 00:07:29.856
Iris would probably enjoy camp much more if she just tried to have fun with her own group.

111
00:07:30.897 --> 00:07:36.762
On top of that, she had something important to focus on: getting better than Javier.

112
00:07:36.782 --> 00:07:39.744
"Gather around, everyone!"

113
00:07:40.585 --> 00:07:42.747
Ally waved the group over after lunch.

114
00:07:42.767 --> 00:07:48.932
"I'd like to announce some changes in how we set up the teams in the final matches this

115
00:07:48.992 --> 00:07:55.157
year. First off, we're going to mix up the teams a little bit, to keep you all on

116
00:07:55.197 --> 00:07:55.798
your toes."

117
00:07:56.438 --> 00:07:58.558
She used air quotes as she spoke.

118
00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:02.960
"So there won't be 'good teams' and 'bad teams.'"

119
00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.421
Ben and some other kids frowned.

120
00:08:06.441 --> 00:08:10.242
"Won't it be hard to get equal teams that way?"

121
00:08:10.722 --> 00:08:11.502
Ben asked.

122
00:08:11.522 --> 00:08:13.643
"You just want to win."

123
00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:15.983
Grace stuck her tongue out at him.

124
00:08:16.003 --> 00:08:18.144
"Give the idea a chance."

125
00:08:18.892 --> 00:08:21.695
Ben shrugged but continued to frown.

126
00:08:21.715 --> 00:08:26.759
"I also have one other change to announce," Ally said.

127
00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.643
Iris and Grace glanced at each other and held their breath.

128
00:08:31.663 --> 00:08:39.389
"Instead of making up each team of one boy and one girl, we're going to pit teams of

129
00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.132
boys against teams of girls."

130
00:08:43.213 --> 00:08:46.055
Everyone gasped and then started laughing.

131
00:08:49.048 --> 00:08:50.669
"Boys against girls?"

132
00:08:51.509 --> 00:08:52.230
Iris thought.

133
00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:57.352
"Hmm Just then Javier shot her a look.

134
00:08:58.193 --> 00:09:01.855
Eyes narrowed, he crossed his arms and gave her a nod.

135
00:09:03.015 --> 00:09:04.196
Iris nodded too.

136
00:09:04.216 --> 00:09:06.037
"Game on!"

137
00:09:06.777 --> 00:09:08.358
she mouthed back at him.
